ailure/2-control RED, 6/6 and 120/120 GREEN, 95/95 DeepSeek streaming, 740/0/4 nonlive, 3/3 live isolated jobs, 150/150 production jobs and Documents, 97/97 replay/boundary, 442/0/1 adjacent, zero migration delta, Web build with zero errors, clean diff check, and matching artifact hashes. The sole residual limitation is QR06-001: five honestly retained, nonintersecting repository-baseline failures prevent claiming a globally green full suite but do not block acceptance of this immutable story boundary."
